  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "接入不变量",
      "items": [
        "下游只消费 *sql.DB：dbconn / registry / CLI 阶段一零改动，owljdbc 仅以 database/sql 驱动身份 init 注册接入",
        "阶段一调用方 = 对拍 harness：sql.Open(\"owljdbc\", agent.EncodeDSN(cfg))，以库方式复用 extractor / exporter / importer"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "双引擎与门控",
      "items": [
        "native 驱动按 build-tag 门控：mysql / lib-pq / go-ora 常驻，ob / og / sqlite3 / duckdb opt-in，缺失时报错并提示 -tags",
        "agent 引擎 = owljdbc 驱动 + JVM sidecar（1 profile = 1 JVM）：接新库 = 驱动 jar + family + URL，通道代码不动"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "阶段二扩展点",
      "items": [
        "产品化待办：config / CLI 增加 agent 通道分发（dbconn.Open 按 type 路由到 owljdbc）+ 新 dialect 族注册",
        "已实测：OB 双租户 / MySQL 8.4 / PG 16.3；登记未测：Oracle / TimesTen / GoldenDB"
      ]
    }
